Package: snp.slicer
Title: Bayesian Nonparametric Resolution of Multi-Strain Infections
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Nianqiao Ju [aut], Maxwell Murphy [cre]
Maintainer: Maxwell Murphy <maxwell.murphy@ucsf.edu>
